## SQ-MT-04 | squid and glow squid flee a cachalot whale at 10 blocks, not at 30; an orca is not fled
@group B
@commands deep ocean: a squid and a glow squid (tagged), a cachalot whale `{NoAI:1b}` 30 blocks off; Pos at 0 s and 10 s; tp the whale 10 blocks from them, Pos at 0 s and 8 s; then the same with an orca `{NoAI:1b}` at 10 blocks
@pass at 30 both wander (no steady drift from the whale); after the tp both are farther from the whale by 8 s (about 14 blocks or more off); the orca at 10: no steady flight
@fails no flight: `SquidsAndWhales` not registered (Alex's Mobs check in `CreativeCompat`) or the goal not added on join; flight from the orca: the goal matches more than `EntityCachalotWhale`
@reviewed 2026-11-24
> locate biome minecraft:deep_ocean
waitlog (The nearest minecraft:deep_ocean is at|Could not find) 600
capture M4O The nearest minecraft:deep_ocean is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {M4O1-48} {M4O3-48} {M4O1+48} {M4O3+48}
sleep 10
> summon minecraft:squid {M4O1} 50 {M4O3} {PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["m4sq"]}
> summon minecraft:glow_squid {M4O1} 50 {M4O3+2} {PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["m4gs"]}
> summon alexsmobs:cachalot_whale {M4O1+30} 50 {M4O3} {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["m4wh"]}
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] Pos
capture M4SA entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4gs,limit=1] Pos
capture M4GA entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4wh,limit=1] Pos
capture M4WA entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
sleep 10
> data get entity @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] Pos
capture M4SB entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4gs,limit=1] Pos
capture M4GB entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> execute as @e[tag=m4wh] at @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] run tp @s ~10 ~ ~
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=m4wh,limit=1] Pos
capture M4WB entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] Pos
capture M4SC entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4gs,limit=1] Pos
capture M4GC entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
sleep 8
> data get entity @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] Pos
capture M4SD entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4gs,limit=1] Pos
capture M4GD entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> kill @e[tag=m4wh]
sleep 3
> execute at @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] run summon alexsmobs:orca ~10 ~ ~ {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["m4or"]}
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=m4or,limit=1] Pos
capture M4OR entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] Pos
capture M4SE entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4gs,limit=1] Pos
capture M4GE entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
sleep 8
> data get entity @e[tag=m4sq,limit=1] Pos
capture M4SF entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=m4gs,limit=1] Pos
capture M4GF entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
shell python3 -c "import math; d=math.dist; w=({M4WA1},{M4WA2},{M4WA3}); w2=({M4WB1},{M4WB2},{M4WB3}); o=({M4OR1},{M4OR2},{M4OR3}); S=[({M4SA1},{M4SA2},{M4SA3}),({M4SB1},{M4SB2},{M4SB3}),({M4SC1},{M4SC2},{M4SC3}),({M4SD1},{M4SD2},{M4SD3}),({M4SE1},{M4SE2},{M4SE3}),({M4SF1},{M4SF2},{M4SF3})]; G=[({M4GA1},{M4GA2},{M4GA3}),({M4GB1},{M4GB2},{M4GB3}),({M4GC1},{M4GC2},{M4GC3}),({M4GD1},{M4GD2},{M4GD3}),({M4GE1},{M4GE2},{M4GE3}),({M4GF1},{M4GF2},{M4GF3})]; [print(n, '30 m: moved', round(d(q[0],q[1]),1), 'whale dist', round(d(q[0],w),1), '->', round(d(q[1],w),1), '| whale at 10: dist', round(d(q[2],w2),1), '-> 8 s', round(d(q[3],w2),1), '| orca at 10: dist', round(d(q[4],o),1), '-> 8 s', round(d(q[5],o),1)) for n,q in (('squid',S),('glow_squid',G))]"
